ng  to the bridge people is in line with  reality and if we vote to remain which I  sincerely hope that we don't on June the  23rd then they will go on with measures  to take us further into a federal  European super-state the whole exercise  in Brussels is not aimed at propping up  the Euro that is the entire mission of  the the European Union they will try to  create a fiscal union a political union  Germany who is effectively the paymaster  of this whole enterprise will want to  insist that there is an economic  governance of Europe that in my view  will eventually become profoundly it's  already profoundly anti-democratic but  it will tend towards the creation of the  United States of Europe into which I'm  afraid Britain will inevitably be sucked  by the usage of single market mechanisms  and I'm afraid we have not been able to  get out from under the obligation  of paying for this whole exercise  ourselves who saw what happened with the  Greek bailout we were hooked on that too  okay totally with that Boris Johnson  thank you timer thanks a lot
 

